  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Human Rights Office in Guinea - 2e phase - 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contribution is to ensure the continuity and consistency necessary to successfully complete the activities initiated during the previous contribution, which ran from 2021 to the end of 2023, and to consolidate the results achieved. 1) Strengthening the rule of law and the fight against impunity
2) Integrating human rights into sustainable development
3) Institutional capacity and international human rights mechanisms</narrative>
